# DEADLINE_SOON: reserving again while already holding a job that is within
# its last-second safety margin (here, its entire 1s ttr) replies
# immediately with DEADLINE_SOON instead of blocking.
@c1 send "put 0 0 1 5\r\nhello\r\n"
@c1 recv
@c1 send "reserve\r\n"
@c1 recv
@c1 send "reserve\r\n"
@c1 recv
